abstract: >-
  Reproducible C++/Python research system for limit-order-book simulation, optimal execution,
  causal microstructure prediction, matched ML-assisted model predictive control, imitation
  learning, reinforcement learning, robustness analysis, statistical inference, and low-latency
  CPU/GPU performance engineering.
